01:02:04,290 --> 01:02:05,810
it was gone in 10 seconds on the boys side.

1154
01:02:06,700 --> 01:02:10,020
30 seconds later, what do I hear on the girls side? 'Can I have 30 more seconds?'

1155
01:02:15,000 --> 01:02:18,990
And then I have people passing-- the
girls are passing back their answers.

1156
01:02:19,140 --> 01:02:22,000
They're handing the paper. 'No no, can I have that back? I need it back, I need it back.'

1157
01:02:22,010 --> 01:02:23,230
'Wait I changed my mind.'

1158
01:02:24,880 --> 01:02:27,020
No boy changed his mind.

1159
01:02:28,400 --> 01:02:31,430
Nobody there is Ijma on this side of the Ummah.

1160
01:02:33,000 --> 01:02:34,980
But the girl's side- and even then

1161
01:02:35,180 --> 01:02:38,310
you get an answer and it's like crossed over three times.

1162
01:02:38,900 --> 01:02:41,230
And my favorite on the girls side.

1163
01:02:41,600 --> 01:02:45,230
By the way I will not tell you what the boys said. You already know what the boys said.

1164
01:02:45,410 --> 01:02:47,420
But I'm gonna say it, so.

1165
01:02:48,800 --> 01:02:53,440
But the girls- one of my favorite answers. My
favorite and it was repeated several times.

1166
01:02:53,450 --> 01:02:56,070
You know what the answer was on the girls side. Any ladies would like to guess.

1167
01:03:02,500 --> 01:03:04,270
You know what the answer was? The answer was?

1168
01:03:04,440 --> 01:03:05,520
It depends.

1169
01:03:12,300 --> 01:03:13,110
So

1170
01:03:16,500 --> 01:03:19,820
Now here's the, here's the- in all seriousness. In all seriousness.

1171
01:03:20,900 --> 01:03:24,920
Allah made men with horse blinders

1172
01:03:26,200 --> 01:03:28,720
And they want some things and that's all they want.

1173
01:03:29,800 --> 01:03:31,810
Allah put that in an Ayah of the Qur'an.

1174
01:03:32,706 --> 01:03:36,184
زُيِّنَ لِلنَّاسِ حُبُّ ٱلشَّهَوَٰتِ مِنَ
ٱلنِّسَآءِ وَٱلْبَنِينَ وَٱلْقَنَٰطِيرِ

1175
01:03:36,208 --> 01:03:40,461
ٱلْمُقَنطَرَةِ مِنَ ٱلذَّهَبِ وَٱلْفِضَّةِ
وَٱلْخَيْلِ ٱلْمُسَوَّمَةِ وَٱلْأَنْعَٰمِ وَٱلْحَرْثِ

1176
01:03:40,510 --> 01:03:42,020
That's men. Done.

1177
01:03:43,200 --> 01:03:45,440
One Ayah. Here's what men want.

1178
01:03:45,550 --> 01:03:47,430
They want--they love beautiful women.

1179
01:03:47,910 --> 01:03:50,580
They want lots of money. They want to have sons.

1180
01:03:50,580 --> 01:03:52,510
They want to have successful businesses.

1181
01:03:53,100 --> 01:03:55,520
You know and you know continual work.

1182
01:03:56,060 --> 01:03:59,120
(وَٱلْأَنْعَٰمِ وَٱلْحَرْثِ) And return on their investments. Men are done.

1183
01:03:59,500 --> 01:04:00,010
'I'm good.'

1184
01:04:01,890 --> 01:04:03,600
Allah never mentioned such a thing for women.

1185
01:04:03,990 --> 01:04:09,510
You know why? Because Allah did not create women with a singular way of thinking.

1186
01:04:10,690 --> 01:04:15,010
Allah did not create women in a monolithic way like He created men.

1187
01:04:15,590 --> 01:04:18,160
Men's psychology is a lot simpler than women's psychology.

1188
01:04:18,160 --> 01:04:19,310
Even in modern psychology.

1189
01:04:20,590 --> 01:04:24,650
That's not to say that women are inferior or they are less than men.

1190
01:04:24,660 --> 01:04:27,700
They are far more complex than men.

1191
01:04:27,710 --> 01:04:30,710
There's a lot more going on with women than is going on with men.

1192
01:04:30,720 --> 01:04:33,010
There's not much going on here for us.

1193
01:04:33,590 --> 01:04:36,220
There's not much, it can be put in one Ayah and you're done.

1194
01:04:36,990 --> 01:04:37,790
Do you understand?

1195
01:04:37,970 --> 01:04:41,880
But I do want to tell ladies something that is important to note here.

1196
01:04:41,890 --> 01:04:43,680
Even though I'm taking time away from that last session

1197
01:04:43,680 --> 01:04:45,210
that I really want to have with you guys.

1198
01:04:45,590 --> 01:04:47,640
But it's important to mention Allah 'azzawajal--

1199
01:04:47,920 --> 01:04:48,981
First of all, I want you to know:

1200
01:04:49,006 --> 01:04:52,405
وَلَكُمْ فِيهَا مَا تَشْتَهِىٓ أَنفُسُكُمْ وَلَكُمْ فِيهَا مَا تَدَّعُونَ

1201
01:04:52,430 --> 01:04:53,997
is a promise of Allah to all human beings.

1202
01:04:54,022 --> 01:04:58,010
Allah says whoever makes it into Jannah, you will get whatever you desired.

1203
01:04:58,590 --> 01:05:02,560
Allah did not mention the desire itself, He said he will get--

1204
01:05:02,570 --> 01:05:05,280
you will get whatever, whatever yourselves

1205
01:05:05,280 --> 01:05:07,220
desire. That includes men and that includes

1206
01:05:07,690 --> 01:05:10,290
women. That's the first thing I'd like to share with you that applies to you.

1207
01:05:10,360 --> 01:05:13,190
In other words, don't worry, you will not be-- some women say,

1208
01:05:13,200 --> 01:05:14,360
'Well men got all this stuff.

1209
01:05:14,360 --> 01:05:15,310
What are we gonna get?'

1210
01:05:16,290 --> 01:05:17,610
'Come on. Just tell me.'

1211
01:05:18,090 --> 01:05:23,090
Allah is telling you whatever you,
want, whatever you want.

1212
01:05:23,100 --> 01:05:26,180
And I have daughters and I love them. And I want them to be in Jannah.

1213
01:05:26,190 --> 01:05:29,000
But I can tell you that's a hard thing because when I

1214
01:05:29,010 --> 01:05:32,240
take them into a store and I say get whatever you want,

1215
01:05:32,250 --> 01:05:35,220
it is the hardest thing they will ever do in their life.

1216
01:05:35,230 --> 01:05:36,910
It is so stressful for them.

1217
01:05:38,090 --> 01:05:40,610
It is so- they're so stressed out.

1218
01:05:41,490 --> 01:05:42,810
About what to get.

1219
01:05:43,690 --> 01:05:45,010
'I'm confused.'

1220
01:05:46,690 --> 01:05:47,610
'I don't know.'

1221
01:05:48,690 --> 01:05:51,300
'Can I have this?' 'Yes, you can have it.' 'No, I don't want it now.'

1222
01:05:57,290 --> 01:05:58,720
In Jannah, you won't have that problem.

1223
01:06:02,280 --> 01:06:03,090
It'll be solved for you.

1224
01:06:04,280 --> 01:06:05,250
Then there's the other thing.

1225
01:06:05,250 --> 01:06:07,700
And by the way, I have tried to figure this out with my wife,

1226
01:06:08,080 --> 01:06:11,160
with my daughters. I have three sisters. I've tried to figure this out with them.

1227
01:06:11,170 --> 01:06:14,380
Sometimes they're upset. And I say, 'What do you want? Tell me what you want.'

1228
01:06:14,390 --> 01:06:16,210
'Just tell, I will do it.'

1229
01:06:17,080 --> 01:06:19,000
'Whatever it is. You just tell me.'

1230
01:06:20,080 --> 01:06:21,130
'You won't understand.'

1231
01:06:28,080 --> 01:06:30,410
'You're right.'

1232
01:06:32,680 --> 01:06:34,500
But I want to say one last thing about this.

1233
01:06:35,280 --> 01:06:35,970
One last thing.

1234
01:06:35,980 --> 01:06:36,380
Promise.

1235
01:06:36,380 --> 01:06:38,670
One last thing and this is actually for all of

1236
01:06:38,670 --> 01:06:41,330
us to appreciate an honor Allah gave to women.

1237
01:06:41,340 --> 01:06:44,310
I personally believe I'm not doing this to please the sisters.

1238
01:06:44,320 --> 01:06:47,100
God knows I've gotten in enough trouble with you guys today already.

1239
01:06:47,480 --> 01:06:50,540
So clearly I'm not out to and interested in making you happy.

1240
01:06:50,690 --> 01:06:51,200
But

1241
01:06:51,980 --> 01:06:53,660
I just want to tell you something- a reality.

1242
01:06:53,670 --> 01:06:59,170
I personally believe in my own studies of the Qur'an that there is an honor

1243
01:06:59,170 --> 01:07:03,410
given to women that is far beyond the honor given to men when it comes to Jannah.

1244
01:07:03,780 --> 01:07:06,320
That's my personal belief. You don't have to share it with me.

1245
01:07:06,330 --> 01:07:07,900
And I'll tell you what it's based on.

1246
01:07:07,925 --> 01:07:10,475
Allah 'azzawajal says in Surat ash-Shura

1247
01:07:10,500 --> 01:07:14,400
that the people who forgive others, they will be, they will be given a reward.

1248
01:07:15,280 --> 01:07:19,710
And the reward is described as (على الله). Their reward is Allah's responsibility.

1249
01:07:20,680 --> 01:07:21,170
In other words,

1250
01:07:21,170 --> 01:07:23,980
the reward was not described as Jannah or rivers

1251
01:07:23,990 --> 01:07:26,560
or fruits or mansions or women or nothing.

1252
01:07:26,780 --> 01:07:29,155
The reward was described as what?

1253
01:07:29,180 --> 01:07:31,790
Allah's responsibility. I'll take care of you. That's all He said.

1254
01:07:32,480 --> 01:07:37,100
And it is, it is my belief that, that Ayah is the greatest reward mentioned in the Qur'an.

1255
01:07:37,880 --> 01:07:38,490
Why?

1256
01:07:38,500 --> 01:07:43,600
Because Allah gave the Qur'an as the most eloquent, the most accurate speech ever.

1257
01:07:44,080 --> 01:07:47,640
The speech that can describe everything and the reward for

1258
01:07:47,640 --> 01:07:51,250
these people is so incredible that it was beyond description.

1259
01:07:51,250 --> 01:07:54,210
Even in the Qur'an, the only thing that can be said is what?

1260
01:07:55,390 --> 01:07:56,300
Allah will take care of you.

1261
01:07:57,580 --> 01:08:01,800
The fact that Allah did not mention what women get in the Qur'an

1262
01:08:02,180 --> 01:08:04,690
is an indication, to me personally,

1263
01:08:04,700 --> 01:08:07,810
you don't have to accept what I'm saying, to me personally,

1264
01:08:07,820 --> 01:08:11,090
it is an indication that what Allah has in store for my mother,

1265
01:08:11,580 --> 01:08:12,700
for my daughters,

1266
01:08:12,890 --> 01:08:13,890
for my sisters,

1267
01:08:14,060 --> 01:08:16,479
for my wife may Allah accept all of our

1268
01:08:16,479 --> 01:08:18,990
mothers and daughters and sisters and wives and to Jannah

1269
01:08:19,569 --> 01:08:22,210
that what Allah has for them is beyond description.

1270
01:08:23,180 --> 01:08:25,000
That it cannot be limited in words.

1271
01:08:25,979 --> 01:08:29,680
The fact that it cannot be limited in words is an honor given to women,

1272
01:08:29,779 --> 01:08:30,990
not a disservice to them.

1273
01:08:31,479 --> 01:08:34,500
It is the lens with which you look at Allah's Rahma

1274
01:08:35,380 --> 01:08:37,500
that will determine what you think about Allah.

1275
01:08:38,380 --> 01:08:41,100
So instead of saying how come Allah didn't say anything,

1276
01:08:41,580 --> 01:08:44,700
You should say 'Whoa,
Allah didn't even describe it.'

1277
01:08:46,100 --> 01:08:47,500
That's a surprise.

1278
01:08:48,670 --> 01:08:50,660
That's the package. You understand sisters?

1279
01:08:51,279 --> 01:08:51,810
Okay.

